<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan to auction 500 mln tenge bills July 22.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan to auction 500 mln tenge bills July 22.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 500 million tenge of three-month MKM discount Treasury bills on July 22, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K2310979</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   500 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 22</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Oct 23, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
